# Daftar

Write the product name as `Daftar` in English. In the UI Arabic label use `دفتر`. Never confuse Daftar with SiteFlow.

SiteFlow is a separate project. Never edit SiteFlow files, remotes, or behavior from Daftar work.

## Product idea

Finishing-contractor project money notebook — same simplicity spirit as مُعَمِّر (Muamer): track what the client paid, what was spent on site, and what remains, with photos and a printable statement.

## Core (in scope)

- Client payments into a project
- Site expenses with optional attachments
- Categories / items for spending
- Money summary: received / spent / remaining
- Photos gallery
- Read-only client portal
- PDF / print statement

## Navigation

- Bottom nav: مشاريع، عملاء، مقاولون، موردون، إعدادات
- Project tabs: مالية، مقاولون، موردون، معرض، إعدادات

## Out of scope

- Not an ERP
- Not SiteFlow advances / supervisor / finance workflow
- Not BOQ / IPC / variations as the primary product

## UX

- Arabic UI, RTL
- Simple colloquial Egyptian Arabic copy
- One job per screen (Muamer simplicity)
- Before changing screens, read `docs/MUAMER.md`. It is the list of what still has to match the Muamer tour.

